From b96a47618ab981bb05be5f96d5ff5fdd5520a3ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AlexProgrammerDE <40795980+AlexProgrammerDE@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 09:50:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(bedrock): add featured server browser

Discover the live Gatherings catalog used by the Bedrock Servers tab and show featured and creator experiences in a dedicated Java-style screen. Include catalog artwork, descriptions, news, activities, live player counts, and server status where an address is published.

Resolve hosted experience addresses through Gatherings before joining, while direct-address entries use the existing Bedrock connection path. Keep sign-in and refresh actions available from the browser.
